# DB no-op: choices is a Python-level constraint Django records in
# migration state but never DDLs into Postgres. Existing 10 action_card
# rows in local DB stay at action_status='draft' (they were generated
# pre-fix and are still valid). Future fallbacks will land as
# 'needs_regen' per the generator's updated branch.

